#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Components file for PineA64 build
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%BaseAddress   0xFC000000
%Image         Build$ImageName
%Log           Build$ImageName
%Messages      Sources.Internat.Messages
%Joiner        romlinker
%JoinerFormat  romlinker
%noimagesize

# BBE Support
BuildApps
BuildExport
BuildSystem             -options COMPONENTFILE=PineA64 COMPONENTFILE2=Universal
BuildEnvironment        -options ENVFILE=PineA64
BuildModules
BuildTools

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# some headers
#
HdrSrc                -type EXP
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# we need the following exported for swis.h generation
# change the type to EXP
#
CompressPNG           -type EXP
DDEUtils              -type EXP
Econet                -type EXP
GPIO                  -type EXP
HostFS                -type EXP
SCSIDriver            -type EXP
PCCardFS              -type EXP
PDriver               -type EXP

# Kernel is first module in ROM seen as the UtilityModule
# The custom StartCMOS value is used to disable Num Lock by default
# The full value maps to ADFS Drive 4 + No Caps + No Dir + No Num
HAL_PineA64
Kernel                -at 0xFC020000 -options ASFLAGS="-PD \"CMOS_Override SETS \\\"= FileLangCMOS,fsnumber_SDFS,CDROMFSCMOS,&C0,StartCMOS,&54\\\"\""
Podule                -type EXP
PCI
SharedRISC_OSLib
FileSwitch
ResourceFS
Messages
MessageTrans
TerritoryManager
